SUMMARY:2026 Park Rhythms Concert Series!
DESCRIPTION:Park Rhythms is returning to Lake Tomahawk!\nConcert-goers are encouraged to bring their own lawn chairs or blankets to each show. Attendees can also bring their own picnics or enjoy one of the many local restaurants nearby.\nIn addition to live music\, each show will also feature a food truck. Attendees are encouraged to bring their own chairs and blankets to set up on the lawn in front of the stage. Due to limited parking\, attendees are also encouraged to carpool\, bike\, or walk from surrounding neighborhoods. Sponsors of the 2026 Park Rhythms Concert Series include Acoustic Corner\, Harvest Records\, Mark Kleive\, DDS\, Pisgah AVL\, The Red Radish Catering Company\, and 88.7 WNCW.
